@startuml
title Framework Agreement Mgt (dtl)

actor "B2B\nCustomer" as Customer

box "CSP"
participant "Engagement\nManagement" as EM
participant "Party Interaction Mgt\nTMFC023" as PIM
participant "POCV\nTMFC002" as POCV
participant "Pdt Catalog\nTMFC001" as Catalog
participant "Agreement Mgt\nTMFC039" as Agreement
end box

box "Supplier"
participant "POCV\nTMFC002" as SupplierPOCV
end box

== 3. Definition of the Framework Agreement (à faire) ==

Customer -> POCV : 3.1a Customer accept CSP's Product Offering (simplified representation)

loop for each ProductOffering (or each Product)
  POCV -> Catalog : 3.1b TMF620 ProductCatalog / Consult Product description
  alt Product is Third Party ProductItem
    POCV -> Agreement : 3.1c TMF651 Agreement Mgt / Consult Supplier Terms & Conditions
    alt Supplier Terms & Conditions requires formal commitment before Agreement validation
      POCV -> SupplierPOCV : 3.2 TMFC0?? ??? Product Offering Qualification ??? for Agreement commitment ?
      note right : tbc
      SupplierPOCV -> POCV : 3.3 Supplier OK
    end
  end
end

Agreement -> Agreement : 3.4 Description of Framework Agreement by CSP
Agreement -> POCV : 3.5 Framework Agreement proposition
POCV -> POCV : 3.6 ProductOffering consolidation (incl. Framework Agreement)
POCV -> Customer : 3.7 Proposition to customer (simplified representation)

@enduml
